"Your EU importer needs embedded-emissions data."

If that e-mail is in your inbox — or will be — the CBAM Evidence Review is the answer.

What it does:
• maps your data sources per installation and production route;
• documents the methodology and identifies the owner of each figure;
• lists the gaps that would push the importer onto default values;
• delivers a file the importer's CBAM declarant can actually use.

What it is not: accredited verification, customs advice or a guarantee of any certificate price.

