Coordinates on WhatsApp. A CAR polygon for the farm. A supplier list without a map. A buyer who needs plot-level geolocation per export lot.

The EUDR Evidence Readiness Review reconciles those four into one dataset:
• plot-level geolocation in the structure the buyer's due diligence statement requires;
• link to production period and export lot;
• provenance of every coordinate;
• gap list by supplier, so you know who to chase first.

Most of the data exists. The review turns it into evidence.

Details: https://www.villanovaesg.com/eudr-evidence-readiness-review/

