Your buyer is estimating your emissions with an industry average. You can replace that estimate with your number — documented, allocated, periodised.

The Scope 3 Brazil Programme documents the Brazilian end of your buyer's value chain over 12 months:
• supplier-specific emissions data in the structure the buyer's reporting needs;
• alignment with CBAM data where products overlap, so one dataset serves both;
• quarterly updates, owners, version control;
• a file the buyer's sustainability and procurement teams can both use.

Details: https://www.villanovaesg.com/scope-3-brazil-programme/

